 * ============================================
 * Anti-bot / cost-protection gate. Runs BEFORE any paid/costly stage
 * (sanitize, verify, enrich, score), so a bot flood never burns Emailable
 * credits, Apollo quota, or Gemini tokens, and never backs up the queue.
